        "event_id": "lite_evt_00131",
        "explanation": "The model explicitly reviews prior turns and patient statements to maintain continuity when deciding next steps.",
        "quote": "同时回看第1-4轮原始对话里患者关于药袋原话和护士站核对结果"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
